            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We have found that patients with chronic ongoing headaches can be treated effectively. The judicious use of an appropriate prophylactic medication combined with counseling, biofeedback and relaxation therapy, physical therapy, and/or stress management can result in the amelioration of the problem in many headache sufferers.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
